  "sourceTitle": "Salad Dressing - Blue Cheese",
  "sourceText": "Salad Dressing - Blue Cheese\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, December 4, 2009 - 11:12pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 qt. Best Food's Mayonnaise\n1 pt. sour cream\nJuice of 2 lemons\nGarlic powder to taste\nBlue cheese\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Blend first four ingredients thoroughly. Add as much blue cheese as you prefer. Keeps about 6 weeks safely when refrigerated.",
